#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:134
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Convert in batch mode, from the command line, without a graphical user "
"interface. You can use this from, say, shell scripts."
msgstr ""
"在指令列進行批次模式轉換，不使用圖形使用者\n"
" 介面。您可以透過如 Shell 腳本來使用此功能。"

#: bin/soundconverter.py.in:147
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Show tags for input files instead of converting them. This disables the "
"graphical user interface."
